@startuml System_Context_Diagram_NotifiED

title System Context Diagram - NotifiED (Simplified per Adviser Feedback)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ranksep 50
skinparam nodesep 50

skinparam rectangle {
    BorderColor #666666
    FontColor #FFFFFF
    FontSize 12
}

skinparam arrow {
    Color #666666
    FontColor #333333
    FontSize 10
}

' ===== Elements =====
rectangle "**Student**\nA university student who wants to discover\ncampus events, view their calendar, access\ninstitutional email, and manage their profile\nfrom a single application." as student #08427B

rectangle "**NotifiED Mobile Application**\nReact Native app providing event discovery,\norganization directory, calendar viewing, email\naccess, AI-assisted interaction, notifications,\nand profile management.\n(Team 2 - our system)" as mobileApp #1168BD

rectangle "**NotifiED Admin**\nManages event submission, approval, and\norganization data. Stores the student's\nNotifiED profile. Exposes this information\nthrough standardized APIs.\n(Developed by Team 1)" as backendService #999999

rectangle "**Microsoft Identity Platform**\nAuthenticates students using their\ninstitutional Microsoft account. Issues\nauthorization tokens to access the\nstudent's calendar and email, and to\nredirect to their institutional email." as msIdentity #999999

' ===== Layout Control (Hidden links to center the mobile app) =====
student -down-> mobileApp : "Signs in, views events,\ncalendar, email access,\nprofile, and notifications"
mobileApp -down-> backendService : "Requests events, organizations,\nand student profile data\n[WebHook / HTTPS]"

mobileApp -right-> msIdentity : "Authenticates student, retrieves\ncalendar, redirects to email\n[OAuth 2.0 / HTTPS]"

@enduml
